---
title: Chicken Noodle Soup
servings: 6
tags: [soup]
prep time: 15 minutes
cook time: 30 minutes
---

Melt @butter{2%tbsp} in a #large pot{} over medium heat. Add @onion{1}(diced), @carrot{3}(sliced) and @celery{3%stalks}(sliced) and cook until softened, about ~{8%minutes}. Add @garlic{2%cloves}(minced).

Pour in @chicken broth{8%cups} and add @chicken breast{1.5%lb}, @bay leaf{1}, @salt{1%tsp} and @black pepper{1/2%tsp}. Bring to a boil, then simmer until the chicken is cooked through, about ~{15%minutes}.

Remove the chicken, shred it, and return it to the pot with @egg noodles{8%oz}. Cook until the noodles are tender, about ~{7%minutes}. Stir in @parsley{1/4%cup}(chopped) and serve.
